- model: blawx.ruledoc
  pk: 1
  fields:
    ruledoc_name: Rock Paper Scissors Act
    rule_text: "Rock Paper Scissors Act\n\n1. 4. The winner of a game is the player who throws a sign that beats the sign of the other player. (Stated once per seat: L4 records are values, Blawx objects are atoms, so a rule that compares two Player records with EQUALS does not survive the flattening - see the tier-1 finding of 2026-09-02.)\n2. 4, the other seat.\n3. 3. The signs are related in the following ways: (a) Rock beats Scissors, (b) Scissors beats Paper, and (c) Paper beats Rock."
    scasp_encoding: ''
    tutorial: ''
    owner: 1
    published: true
- model: blawx.workspace
  pk: 1
  fields:
    ruledoc: 1
    workspace_name: root_section
    xml_content: |-
      <xml xmlns="https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml">
      <block type="unattributed_fact" id="l4b000001" x="40" y="40"><statement name="statements"><block type="new_category_declaration" id="l4b000002"><field name="category_name">player</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="postfix">is a player</field><next><block type="new_category_declaration" id="l4b000003"><field name="category_name">game</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="postfix">is a game</field><next><block type="new_category_declaration" id="l4b000004"><field name="category_name">sign</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="postfix">is a sign</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000005"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="player" attribute_type="sign"></mutation><field name="category_name">player</field><field name="attribute_name">throws</field><field name="attribute_type">sign</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix">has throws of</field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix"></field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000006"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="game" attribute_type="player"></mutation><field name="category_name">game</field><field name="attribute_name">first_player</field><field name="attribute_type">player</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix">has first player of</field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix"></field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000007"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="game" attribute_type="player"></mutation><field name="category_name">game</field><field name="attribute_name">second_player</field><f